1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,585
How's your leg?

2
00:00:02,836 --> 00:00:05,755
Not great.

3
00:00:06,214 --> 00:00:08,466
Seung‑hyun

4
00:00:08,466 --> 00:00:10,677
are you mad at me?

5
00:00:10,885 --> 00:00:13,138
No.

6
00:00:13,138 --> 00:00:15,974
Then why wouldn't you
open the door?

7
00:00:15,974 --> 00:00:18,893
Why didn't you
return my calls?

8
00:00:18,893 --> 00:00:21,396
Tell me the truth.

9
00:00:21,781 --> 00:00:22,866
About what?

10
00:00:24,781 --> 00:00:27,784
What did you feel

11
00:00:27,849 --> 00:00:30,685
when you first agreed
to take me in?

12
00:00:30,686 --> 00:00:32,604
Why are you asking me that
all of a sudden?

13
00:00:32,605 --> 00:00:35,608
I know what
the coach told you.

14
00:00:36,004 --> 00:00:39,007
He must've asked you to take
me in saying I had issues.

15
00:00:41,149 --> 00:00:43,276
That's not true.

16
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:45,545
Really?

17
00:00:45,631 --> 00:00:47,800
Not even once.

18
00:00:48,061 --> 00:00:50,230
Jeong-min lied to you.

19
00:00:50,425 --> 00:00:53,428
So he tricked me?

20
00:00:53,511 --> 00:00:55,805
He even planted a bug

21
00:00:55,805 --> 00:00:58,850
at the futsal center.

22
00:00:59,059 --> 00:01:02,062
You mean...
he heard everything we said?

23
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:05,774
Most likely.

24
00:01:06,948 --> 00:01:10,562
What do we do now?

25
00:01:16,159 --> 00:01:18,286
I'm sorry, Ji-sung.

26
00:01:19,496 --> 00:01:21,414
I'm really sorry.

27
00:01:23,328 --> 00:01:24,871
No, I'm the one who's sorry

28
00:01:26,127 --> 00:01:27,754
for not protecting you.

29
00:01:27,754 --> 00:01:29,130
Why are you apologizing?

30
00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:32,133
You didn't do anything wrong.

31
00:01:32,717 --> 00:01:35,011
I won't let anything
like this happen again.

32
00:01:35,011 --> 00:01:38,014
I promise.

33
00:01:51,069 --> 00:01:54,072
Come with me.
Let's go see Jeong-min.
